{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22383","headline":"以镜赠别 · 白居易","name":"以镜赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人言似明月，我道胜明月。\n明月非不明，一年十二缺。\n岂如玉匣里，如水常澄澈。\n月破天闇时，圆明独不歇。\n我慙貌丑老，绕鬓斑斑雪。\n不如赠少年，回照青丝发。\n因君千里去，持此将爲别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}